# Allow-list: the build context carries only what the Dockerfile copies.
# `data/`, `.cme/` and `.env*` hold Confluence credentials, manifests and
# exports — they must never reach the builder, let alone a layer.
# A new COPY needs its own line below, or the build fails with "not found".
*
!patch_cme_urls.py
!cme_mcp_server.py
!cme_source_urls.py
!confluence_search.py
!wiki_search.py
